t: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/ci_watch_notification_plus_one.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-y6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-y6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust notification store +1 model and upsert[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add plus-one entries and a dedup key to the Rust notification row,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an append-plus-one operation, and an atomic create-or-plus-one/supersede[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]upsert with parity tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase notify +1 and create upsert[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: mirror the new wire in Python, add the notify +1 subcommand and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]create dedup-key/plus-one/supersede flags, and render +1 evidence in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notify list/show and JSON.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Notification panel +1 badges and iteration[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: render +1 badges and an evidence section in the ACE notification [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]modal, add a + key that cycles the detail pane through +1 notes, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the PNG snapshot suites.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ci_watch incident-combination notifications[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chop[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop: collapse per-repo ci_watch failure notifications into one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]incident-combination notification that +1s material deltas, supersedes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]itself when a new repo starts failing, and falls back to legacy behavior[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on older sase CLIs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrated verification and config alignment[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel, chop[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: run both repos' verification lanes plus the monitored check-full[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]landing gate, smoke the upsert end to end, and align the chezmoi-managed[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop description with the new subprocess surface.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-y6","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-y6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"Git (bare)"},"source_run_id":"run-ec31e5c2c6e2b14201c71074e5f9a85c","started_at":"2026-09-07T21:10:31.904213+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-y6.land"]}
